{"id":"659447","name":"艾叶鸽子煲","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659447/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸽子","amount":"一只"},{"name":"干艾叶","amount":"20g"},{"name":"熟鸡蛋","amount":"4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"5颗"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸽子。","img":"images/659447/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"三蒸三晒的干艾叶，红枣、姜片。","img":"images/659447/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸽子剁成块，红枣对半切开半，艾叶用清水泡软。","img":"images/659447/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备几个熟鸡蛋。","img":"images/659447/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅热油，炒香姜片。","img":"images/659447/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入鸽子翻炒。","img":"images/659447/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸽子炒至干香，放入红枣。","img":"images/659447/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入娘酒。","img":"images/659447/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入一碗清水，炆火烧开。","img":"images/659447/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取砂锅，锅内放入艾叶。","img":"images/659447/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把炒好的鸽子肉铲入砂锅。","img":"images/659447/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再把剥好皮的鸡蛋放入锅内一起炖煮。","img":"images/659447/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"小火焖20分钟即可。","img":"images/659447/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。味道清香，益气补血。","img":"images/659447/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}